emergencySweep.tree
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── given lastEmergencySweep is zero
    │   └── it should revert with EmergencySweepCooldownNotReached
    ├── given cooldown period has not passed
    │   └── it should revert with EmergencySweepCooldownNotReached
    └── given cooldown period has passed
        └── when sweeping token
            ├── it should transfer all token balance to owner
            └── it should use safeTransfer for the transfer
